name: sim.setIkElementProperties
description: Sets properties of a specific IK element.
luaSynopsis: sim.setIkElementProperties(int ikGroupHandle,int tipDummyHandle,int constraints,float[2] precision=nil,float[2] weight=nil
inputs (possibly taken/adapted from C-function counterpart. Adjust accordingly):
1. ikGroupHandle: handle of the IK group that contains the IK element to modify
2. tipDummyHandle: handle of the tip dummy object of the IK element
3. constraints: the constraints of the ik element. sim.ik_avoidance_constraint is not allowed
4. precision: an array of two values where the first represents the linear precision, and the second the angular precision. Can be nullptr to keep current settings.
5. weight: an array of two values that represent the linear and angular resolution weights. Can be nullptr to keep current settings.
6. reserved: reserved for future extensions. Keep at nullptr
outputs (possibly taken/adapted from C-function counterpart. Adjust accordingly):
